# Root-level .env.example — see apps/api/.env.example and apps/web/.env.example
# for the full list of required keys per service.
#
# Quick summary of what you need:
#
#   apps/api/.env
#   ├── DATABASE_URL         — Supabase direct Postgres connection string
#   ├── SUPABASE_URL         — your Supabase project URL
#   ├── SUPABASE_ANON_KEY    — public anon key (safe to expose)
#   ├── SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY — secret service role key (never expose)
#   ├── S3_* keys            — Supabase Storage S3 credentials
#   ├── DEEPGRAM_API_KEY     — speech-to-text
#   ├── OPENAI_API_KEY       — primary LLM
#   ├── GEMINI_API_KEY       — vision / document OCR
#   └── GROQ_API_KEY         — fallback LLM
#
#   apps/web/.env
#   ├── VITE_SUPABASE_URL    — same as above
#   └── VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY — same anon key
